<title>SRI LANKA: James Finlay 9-month net up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>James Finlay 9-month net up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of James Finlay &amp; Co (Colombo) Ltd, for the nine months to September 30 of the 1996 financial year. (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			 9 months 1996     9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    684.60		551.43</p>
<p>    Net profit	   29.00		 27.10</p>
<p>    Tax provision	 4.12		  4.53</p>
<p>NOTE - The company exports tea, manages plantations, is in pest control, industrial and agro chemicals, travel and tourism.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
